Subject: [electron] override WebGL and WebGPU adapter identifiers

An agent persona passes these values on the renderer command line. The
switches are absent unless that renderer belongs to a persona session, so
other processes keep Chromium's behavior. Nothing here is compiled in this
change.

diff --git a/third_party/blink/renderer/modules/webgl/webgl_rendering_context_base.cc b/third_party/blink/renderer/modules/webgl/webgl_rendering_context_base.cc
